<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 90,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 90,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est 90,000, Wk ago 104,000, and Yr ago 99,000 head at interior Iowa and southern Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts sold $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Monday. Trade was slow for light demand and offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
